      "hizbQuarter": 71,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1180,
      "text": "O you who believe, obey Allah and His Messenger, and do not turn away from him after hearing [his command].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 8,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنفَالِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anfaal",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spoils of War",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 9,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 179,
      "ruku": 148,
      "hizbQuarter": 71,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1181,
      "text": "And do not be like those[10] who say, “We hear,” while they do not actually listen.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 8,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنفَالِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anfaal",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spoils of War",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 9,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 179,
      "ruku": 148,
      "hizbQuarter": 71,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1182,
      "text": "The worst of creatures before Allah are those who are deaf and dumb, and who do not understand.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 8,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنفَالِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anfaal",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spoils of War",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 9,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 179,
      "ruku": 148,
      "hizbQuarter": 72,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1183,
      "text": "If Allah had known any good in them[11], He would have made them hear, but even if He had made them hear, they would have turned away in aversion.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 8,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنفَالِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anfaal",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Spoils of War",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
